        "explanation_html": "<section class=\"dtos-explanation\" aria-label=\"DTOS trade assessment\"><h3>DTOS trade assessment</h3><p class=\"tw-final-verdict\">NOT WORTH IT</p><section class=\"tw-decision\" aria-label=\"Trade decision summary\"><section class=\"tw-decision-lead\" aria-label=\"Decision and next step\"><p>Why this decision: The supported lineup cost is not compensated by Market or depth evidence.</p><p>Next step: Do not pursue this package on the recorded evidence. Review its costs before editing.</p></section><section class=\"tw-decision-market\" aria-label=\"Current Market comparison\"><h4>Current Market</h4><div class=\"tw-market-caption\"><span>You send <b>325</b></span><span>You receive <b>325</b></span></div><div class=\"tw-market-bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Current Market totals are equal.\"><span class=\"neutral\" style=\"flex-basis:50.000%\"></span><span class=\"neutral\" style=\"flex-basis:50.000%\"></span></div><p>Current Market totals are equal.</p><small>Current values, not trade-date grades. Market advantage is separate from strategy and lineup impact.</small></section><p class=\"tw-drawback\">Optimal legal-lineup production falls 10.00 points per supported week; Reserve replacement production is unavailable for some requested weeks</p><p class=\"tw-drawback\">Projection evidence is Unavailable; retained numerical evidence is provisional, not freshly verified.</p><section class=\"tw-team-summary\" aria-label=\"Current projected lineup effects\"><section><h4>Your team</h4><p>Your team: Conditional Season 2026, week 8 optimal-lineup change -10.00 projected points.</p></section><section><h4>Their team</h4><p>Their team: Conditional Season 2026, week 8 optimal-lineup change +0.00 projected points.</p></section></section><p>Inspect the main drawback, edit or reevaluate this trade.</p><details class=\"tw-team-impact-details\"><summary>Both teams \u00b7 depth, costs and conditions</summary><h4>Your team</h4><p>Conditional average across supported weeks 8: -10.00 projected points per week; not a season forecast.</p><p>Before/after lineup evidence remains missing for weeks 9, 10; the supported-week average does not fill that gap.</p><p>Neutral Market: 325 sent / 325 received; this is value compensation, not acceptance evidence.</p><p>Useful replacement-depth coverage is incomplete; a missing reserve effect is not zero.</p><p>Season 2026, week 8 reserve cover: before 10.00 points (supported, 1 covered reserve slots); after 10.00 points (supported, 1 covered reserve slots).</p><p>Conditional week 8 reserve-production change: +0.00 points; not an injury forecast or a second starting lineup.</p><p>Week 8 \u00b7 Before and after: Projection source freshness is qualified; these are conditional projections, not guaranteed production.</p><p>Week 8 \u00b7 Before and after: Original projection observations are not confirmed Fresh; replacement production remains conditional.</p><p>Other weekly reserve effects and coverage gaps are listed separately in Before and after \u00b7 both optimal lineups.</p><h4>Their team</h4><p>Conditional average across supported weeks 8: +0.00 projected points per week; not a season forecast.</p><p>Before/after lineup evidence remains missing for weeks 9, 10; the supported-week average does not fill that gap.</p><p>Neutral Market: 325 sent / 325 received; this is value compensation, not acceptance evidence.</p><p>Useful replacement-depth coverage is incomplete; a missing reserve effect is not zero.</p><p>Season 2026, week 8 reserve cover: before 10.00 points (supported, 1 covered reserve slots); after 20.00 points (supported, 1 covered reserve slots).</p><p>Conditional week 8 reserve-production change: +10.00 points; not an injury forecast or a second starting lineup.</p><p>Week 8 \u00b7 Before and after: Projection source freshness is qualified; these are conditional projections, not guaranteed production.</p><p>Week 8 \u00b7 Before and after: Original projection observations are not confirmed Fresh; replacement production remains conditional.</p><p>Other weekly reserve effects and coverage gaps are listed separately in Before and after \u00b7 both optimal lineups.</p><p class=\"tw-drawback\">Their manager strategy is unconfirmed; rebuilding or contending intent is not established.</p><p class=\"tw-drawback\">Market fairness and receiving a pick do not establish rebuilding intent or predict acceptance.</p><p>This package is rejected under the recorded assessment: User-side conclusion from separate Market, optimal-lineup, package, capital and strategy evidence; counterparty plausibility is separate. Evidence gaps do not remove that objection.</p><p>Review:</p><p>Your team&#x27;s compatible player-week projections and legal pre/post lineups.</p><p>Your team&#x27;s compatible reserve-depth evidence.</p><p>Their team&#x27;s compatible player-week projections and legal pre/post lineups.</p><p>Their team&#x27;s compatible reserve-depth evidence.</p><p>Wait for compatible evidence or inspect a counterparty with supported coverage; adding a pick cannot fix missing projections.</p><p>Their principal cost: Reserve replacement production is unavailable for some requested weeks</p></details><details class=\"tw-player-facts\"><summary>Player production, projections and rank definitions</summary><section><h4>Example 1-10</h4><p>QB \u00b7 BUF \u00b7 Age unavailable \u00b7 Active</p><p>Listed position eligibility: QB. Availability and roster rules are assessed separately in the legal lineup.</p><p>Market positional rank: QB2 \u00b7 Priced rostered players in the selected league.</p><p>Current Market: 325.</p><p>Sleeper projection: 20.00 \u00b7 Season 2026 \u00b7 Week 8 \u00b7 Unavailable.</p><p>Sleeper actual production: Unavailable points per completed-week score observation \u00b7 Unknown observations \u00b7 Season 2026 \u00b7 Selected league. This is not a games-played average.</p><p>Season fantasy-points rank / points-per-game rank: unavailable; no complete compatible cohort is prepared.</p><details><summary>Player fact sources and coverage</summary><p>Projection source observation: Unknown; source generation: 00267392b2bf871671718e230e3f2c676c7cc58ebe75792e368b2bf36e464209.</p><p>Unavailable</p><p>Actual production source: Unavailable; league one-qb; generation Unavailable; observation Unknown.</p><p>Compatible prepared actual production is unavailable; no zero or season rank is inferred.</p></details></section><section><h4>Example 2-0</h4><p>QB \u00b7 BUF \u00b7 Age unavailable \u00b7 Active</p><p>Listed position eligibility: QB. Availability and roster rules are assessed separately in the legal lineup.</p><p>Market positional rank: QB9 \u00b7 Priced rostered players in the selected league.</p><p>Current Market: 325.</p><p>Sleeper projection: 10.00 \u00b7 Season 2026 \u00b7 Week 8 \u00b7 Unavailable.</p><p>Sleeper actual production: Unavailable points per completed-week score observation \u00b7 Unknown observations \u00b7 Season 2026 \u00b7 Selected league. This is not a games-played average.</p><p>Season fantasy-points rank / points-per-game rank: unavailable; no complete compatible cohort is prepared.</p><details><summary>Player fact sources and coverage</summary><p>Projection source observation: Unknown; source generation: 00267392b2bf871671718e230e3f2c676c7cc58ebe75792e368b2bf36e464209.</p><p>Unavailable</p><p>Actual production source: Unavailable; league one-qb; generation Unavailable; observation Unknown.</p><p>Compatible prepared actual production is unavailable; no zero or season rank is inferred.</p></details></section></details></section><details class=\"tw-lineup-details\"><summary>Before and after \u00b7 both optimal lineups</summary><p>Analytical optimal lineups, independently optimized before and after the proposed trade. These are not your submitted Sleeper starters; no lineup is changed. Conditional projections do not guarantee availability.</p><p>Displayed points are rounded; team totals use unrounded projections.</p><section class=\"tw-lineup-week\"><h4>Your franchise \u00b7 Season 2026 \u00b7 Week 8</h4><p>Selected league scoring \u00b7 provisional comparison.</p><p>Entering optimal starters: Example 2-0</p><p>Leaving optimal starters: Example 1-10</p><div class=\"tw-lineup-phases\"><section><h5>Before trade</h5><table class=\"tw-lineup-table\"><caption>Before trade \u00b7 analytical optimal starters</caption><thead><tr><th>Slot</th><th>Player \u00b7 position</th><th>Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">QB</th><td>Example 1-10<small>QB</small></td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">RB 1</th><td>Example 1-2<small>RB</small></td><td>10</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">RB 2</th><td>Example 1-6<small>RB</small></td><td>10</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">WR 1</th><td>Example 1-4<small>WR</small></td><td>15</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">WR 2</th><td>Example 1-7<small>WR</small></td><td>15</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">TE</th><td>Example 1-5<small>TE</small></td><td>10</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FLEX 1</th><td>Example 1-3<small>WR</small></td><td>15</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">FLEX 2</th><td>Example 1-1<small>RB</small></td><td>10</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">K</th><td>Example 1-8<small>K</small></td><td>6</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">DEF</th><td>Example 1-9<small>DEF</small></td><td>4</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Week total: 115</b></p><table class=\"tw-lineup-table\"><caption>Before trade \u00b7 disjoint projected reserve cover</caption><thead><tr><th>Slot</th><th>Player \u00b7 position</th><th>Points</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">QB</th><td>Example 1-0<small>QB</small></td><td>10</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Reserve production: 10 points \u00b7 1 covered reserve slots \u00b7 1 eligible reserve candidates.</p><p>Reserve cover has supported projection evidence; availability qualifications still apply. This is disjoint projected cover, not a second required starting lineup.</p><p>Unfilled reserve-cover slots: DEF, K, 